# Line endings: the repository holds both CRLF and LF text files (about 180 CRLF, mostly engine/playtests,
# tools/oracle_scenarios, some engine sources and the archive; the rest LF). Git must not convert either way, so a
# checkout is byte-identical to what was committed whatever core.autocrlf says. A modified file keeps its own endings
# (tools/hooks/eol_check.py runs on commit; .editorconfig does not force a style).
* -text

# Binary files (none are committed today; images such as docs/images/preview.png may be)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.dds binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.bin binary

# GitHub language statistics: third-party sources kept with the archive are not this project's code
archive/third_party/** linguist-vendored
